# Baylen, the Haymaker: "Tap four untapped tokens you control: Put three +1/+1 counters on Baylen. It gains trample until end of
# turn." The ability's cost is tapping tokens, not the {T} symbol, so the Spirit tokens made by Lingering Souls on turn 1 and its
# flashback on turn 3 can all be tapped at once. Baylen (4/3) becomes 7/6 and has trample until end of turn only; it is
# 7/6 without trample on turn 5.

